Explanation: Installed as /etc/apt/preferences.d/nodesource.pref by deploy/nodesource.sh (#6).
Explanation: nodejs comes from NodeSource, never universe's 18. Pinned by host because the
Explanation: repo's Release Origin is aptly's generic ". nodistro". 600: above 500, below 1000.
Package: nodejs
Pin: origin deb.nodesource.com
Pin-Priority: 600

Explanation: Everything else this host serves (nsolid, and whatever it adds) stays below
Explanation: Ubuntu's 500: the maintenance lane's site=deb.nodesource.com selects the whole
Explanation: site, so this is what scopes NodeSource to Node. The nodejs entry above wins.
Package: *
Pin: origin deb.nodesource.com
Pin-Priority: 100
